  m_Text: 'A / D  or  arrows  -  steer the canoe

    Space  -  paddle hard (faster,
    uses energy)

    S  -  slow down for tight spots


    Grab the yellow boxes.
    Rocks, logs and hippos break your canoe.

    Fast water pushes you to the side.
    Watch the sun!'
